=2 Walkthrough
* Warp to the {z:Western Adoulin} **Waterfront** (Waypoint #9) and examine the **Port Storage** door at (J-4) for a cutscene.
* You are asked to bring ONE of the following items to Guilberien:
** {i:Eft Skin|Eft Skin|1623} (x5)
** {i:Manticore Hair|Manticore Hair|1163} (x4)
** {i:Buffalo Horn|Buffalo Horn|1615}
** {i:Manticore Leather}
** {i:Buffalo Leather|Buffalo Leather|1629}
* When you have acquired the item(s) tasked of you, trade it to the door **Port Storage** at (J-4) for another cutscene with Guilberien.
* The specific item asked for depends on the level of your bond with {p:Arciela}, with {i:Buffalo Horn|Buffalo Horn|1615} indicating the lowest level.[1]

